      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSIC BOODIE (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 6th at this track in Grade 5 company. Has a good record here at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. MIDNIGHT MADNESS (3) missed the frame last time but prior to that was an effortless P5 winner (16.91) at this track, scoring by 2.5 lengths. Well placed here and can atone this time. FLIGHTS BOOKED (5) scored by 2 lengths last time (19.63) in a Restricted WIN over 352m at Q Lakeside. Looks suited here and can measure up. HARDLY EASY (2) placed two back in a Grade 5 at this track then backed that up with a third (17.00) over 300m at this track last time.",
